                "text": "The weather in San Francisco is around 22°C (about 72°F) and windy. Here are some clothing recommendations for this weather:\n\n- **Light Layers**: A light long-sleeve shirt or a light sweater, as it may get cooler with the wind.\n- **Jacket**: A light windbreaker or denim jacket to protect against the breeze.\n- **Bottoms**: Comfortable pants or jeans are a good option.\n- **Footwear**: Sneakers or comfortable shoes suitable for walking.\n- **Accessories**: Consider wearing sunglasses and perhaps a light scarf if it feels a bit chilly.\n\nEnjoy your time in San Francisco!"
